      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i'm just standing in the middle of the subway station during rush hour and it hits me how easy it would be to just... not exist. like everyone is rushing past and nobody even looks up. if i just disappeared tomorrow i dont think the city would even skip a beat. it feels like i'm just a ghost already.",
