      "content": "Those feelings are incredibly valid, especially when surrounded by the relentless pace of a massive city where individual struggles often feel swallowed whole. Please know that your value isn't measured by how financially or professionally functional you are, but by the unique presence you bring to every interaction you do have. You are not a speck, even when the noise around you makes it feel like that, because you are real and your next step is exactly one of the most important parts of the day.",
