    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to keep the engine running. like, the system needs us to keep functioning so the city keeps moving. but if i'm actually just a cog, and a tiny, broken one at that... does it really matter if the cog is removed? it feels like there's this huge, quiet logic to just letting go. like it would be more peaceful to just stop fighting the scale of it all.",
